</span>



    <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

    <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2019-06-07T22:29:52.000Z" aria-label="June 7, 2019" class="we-customer-review__date" >06/07/2019</time>
  </div>

    <h3 class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line  we-customer-review__title" dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-3161">
    Blocked
</h3>



      <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>I have never heard of this app until I kept getting strange calls from people saying they got my number off this app. I eventually logged in because all it asks is for your phone number and password (I clicked on forgot password and got a link sent to my phone). They had a whole account set up and were using it to talk to people!!! So whoever was using this account was using my phone number!!! Not cool!!! Stupid teenage kids</p>
    


<!----></blockquote>



<!----></div>

              
</div>

          
    
